/T (Kazakh cuisine was shaped by the nomadic way of life and the harsh steppe climate. It is based on meat and dairy products, rich in nutrients and energy, essential for survival in extreme conditions. Key ingredients include lamb, beef, horse meat, dairy products, and grains such as millet and wheat.)
